Under the Paystride Earned Wage Access Program Agreement a larger overdue balance adds to the late charge rate on a shortfall notice the employer is liable for. Measured on the notice's open amount (the open amount of the deduction schedule it concerns):

- at least 40000 US dollars: 0.15 percentage points are added;
- at least 10000 but below 40000 US dollars: 0.1 percentage points are added;
- below 10000 US dollars: none.

Both lower edges are inclusive: an open amount of exactly 40000.00 takes 0.15 points, one of 39999.99 takes 0.1, one of exactly 10000.00 takes 0.1, and one of 9999.99 takes none (hypothetical amounts).
